3. Maple Mono NF CN (The Maple Mono Project Authors)
   URL:     https://github.com/subframe7536/maple-font
   Release: v7.9 MapleMono-NF-CN.zip
   License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1)
   Copyright 2022 The Maple Mono Project Authors
   Use:     Homepage notes (#featured-notes, #latest-notes) and post
            code snippets (pre / .astro-code). Self-hosted WOFF2 at
            public/fonts/MapleMono-NF-CN-Regular.woff2 encoded from the
            official MapleMono-NF-CN-Regular.ttf. OFL text is at
            public/fonts/OFL.txt.

   Ligatures: extra operator sets ss03 ss07 ss08 ss09 ss10 ss11 are
   frozen into calt in the shipped WOFF2 (Maple Mono's browser freeze).
   CSS only turns calt on. That covers == != => -> && :: ++ // >>
   [TODO]-style tags, plus >>= |= /= ~=. ss01 ss02 ss04 are emptied
   so IBM Plex's body ss01 cannot swap in the broken-equals glyphs.

   Remaining limits:
   - Only Regular is shipped. Letter joins such as ff / tt / al / il
     exist on Italic only, so they do not appear in upright code.
   - ss06 is italic-only; it is not enabled.
   - HTML <title>, Open Graph, Twitter, and RSS stay English.
   - Transfer size of the NF CN Regular WOFF2 is 6,294,324 bytes.
